#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:5
#: 67abcf6513004f598425de5c80daca37
msgid "Using SITL"
msgstr "使用 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:7
#: cbff536daea949ce8cc9f7e841f039f8
msgid ""
"This article describes how :ref:`SITL <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-"
"loop>` can be used to change the environment, simulate failure modes, and"
" configure the vehicle with optional components."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何使用 :ref:`SITL <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` "
"改变环境、模拟故障模式并为飞行器配置可选组件。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:9
#: 962ad6ad83224b2cb9e97780a197ab98
msgid ""
"SITL can be run under Linux using a tool named ``sim_vehicle.py`` from a "
"Linux or WSL2 command line, or through :ref:`Mission Planner's Simulation"
" feature <mission-planner-simulation>`. It can also be run in conjunction"
" with a graphics visualization and/or physics modeling program like "
":ref:`Realflight<sitl-with-realflight>`."
msgstr ""
"SITL 可在 Linux 下通过 Linux 或 WSL2 命令行使用名为 ``sim_vehicle.py`` 的工具运行，也可通过 "
":ref:`Mission Planner 的仿真功能 <mission-planner-simulation>` "
"运行。它还可与图形可视化和/或物理建模程序（如 :ref:`Realflight<sitl-with-realflight>`）结合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:11
#: 3a02791ba79343218df83ab7bfb1d92a
msgid ""
"In addition to running the simulation, a ground control station program "
"will need to be run concurrently in order to control the simulation. With"
" ``sim_vehicle.py``, `MAVProxy "
"<https://ardupilot.org/mavproxy/index.html>`__ is automatically started. "
"When using Mission Planner's simulation feature, it is used. You can also"
" have more than one GCS attached, see :ref:`connect to different GCSs "
"<using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing_connecting_otheradditional_ground_stations>`."
msgstr ""
"除了运行仿真外，还需要同时运行地面站程序以控制仿真。使用 ``sim_vehicle.py`` 时，`MAVProxy "
"<https://ardupilot.org/mavproxy/index.html>`__ 会自动启动。使用 Mission Planner "
"的仿真功能时，使用 Mission Planner 本身。您也可以连接多个地面站，参见 :ref:`连接到不同地面站 <using-sitl-"
"for-ardupilot-testing_connecting_otheradditional_ground_stations>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:15
#: ba56549c1f564fd799c1087aa9d6c752
msgid ""
"This page assumes you have already cloned the repository and set up the "
"build environment if you wish to simulate your own code - see "
":ref:`Building the code <building-the-code>`, although this is not needed"
" if using :ref:`Mission Planner's Simulation feature <mission-planner-"
"simulation>` since it can easily run simulations on the current "
"development code or stable code versions."
msgstr ""
"如果您希望仿真自己的代码，本页假设您已克隆仓库并设置好构建环境，请参见 :ref:`构建代码 <building-the-code>`；但如果使用"
" :ref:`Mission Planner 的仿真功能 <mission-planner-"
"simulation>`，则不需要，因为它可以轻松运行当前开发代码或稳定版本的仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:19
#: 727ca93dc35a40f6ab2030714eeb710e
msgid ""
"If you're just getting started with MAVProxy and SITL you may wish to "
"start by reading the :ref:`Copter SITL/MAVProxy Tutorial <copter-sitl-"
"mavproxy-tutorial>` (or equivalent tutorials for the other vehicles)."
msgstr ""
"如果您刚开始使用 MAVProxy 和 SITL，建议先阅读 :ref:`Copter SITL/MAVProxy 教程 <copter-"
"sitl-mavproxy-tutorial>` （或其他飞行器的同类教程）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:25
#: 5b3d6b856c1d4c2db8e9e0df962b7837
msgid ""
"These instructions generally use :ref:`MAVProxy <mavproxy-developer-gcs>`"
" to describe operations (e.g. setting parameters) because it presents a "
"simple and consistent command-line interface (removing the need to "
"describe a GCS-specific UI layout). Many of these operations can also be "
"performed in *Mission Planner* (through the *Full Parameters List*) or "
"any other GCS."
msgstr ""
"这些说明通常使用 :ref:`MAVProxy <mavproxy-developer-gcs>` "
"来描述操作（例如设置参数），因为它提供了简单一致的命令行界面（无需描述特定 GCS 的 UI 布局）。许多操作也可以在 *Mission "
"Planner*（通过「Full Parameters List」）或任何其他地面站中执行。"

