#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:117
#: 5cc66750688840a49644ff9bba1d2c74
msgid ""
"It is important to select the proper frame type. This not only loads the "
"correct parameter set, but also selects the correct physics model. In "
"real life, for example, you can configure and setup the ArduPlane "
"firmware for any QuadPlane, but you cannot do that in SITL without having"
" selected the exact QuadPlane frame type for the simulation to get the "
"correct physics model. If a frame type is not selected, a default set for"
" the vehicle type will be loaded, as indicated above."
msgstr ""
"选择正确的机架类型非常重要。这不仅会加载正确的参数集，还会选择正确的物理模型。例如，在实际情况中，您可以为任何 QuadPlane 配置和设置 "
"ArduPlane 固件，但在 SITL 中，必须选择精确的 QuadPlane "
"机架类型才能使仿真使用正确的物理模型。如果未选择机架类型，将加载如上所述的飞行器类型默认设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:121
