#: e8eb0da5e0a14022b251476676f7840c
msgid ""
"You can start the simulator with the vehicle at a particular location by "
"calling **sim_vehicle.py** with the ``-L`` parameter and a named location"
" in the `ardupilot/Tools/autotest/locations.txt "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/locations.txt>`__"
" file."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过使用 ``-L`` 参数和 `ardupilot/Tools/autotest/locations.txt "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/locations.txt>`__"
" 文件中的命名地点来启动仿真器，并将飞行器设置在特定位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:129
#: d4cc64205a5043538be4e096e82260bf
msgid ""
"For example, to start Copter in *Ballarat* (a named location in "
"**locations.txt**) call:"
msgstr "例如，要在 *Ballarat*（**locations.txt** 中的命名位置）启动 Copter，请调用："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:139
#: 39f30dab06d143f292ad3f653d016ce3
msgid ""
"You can add your own locations to the file. The order is "
"Lat,Lng,Alt,Heading where alt is MSL and in meters, and heading is "
"degrees. If the flying location is well-used then consider adding it to "
"the project via a pull request."
msgstr ""
"您可以向文件添加自己的位置。格式为纬度、经度、高度、航向，其中高度为 MSL 海拔（米），航向为度数。如果该飞行地点使用频繁，请考虑通过 PR "
"将其添加到项目中。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:144
#: 0cf52b32d56d4e90bb0f7f0970bb7a3b
msgid ""
"You can add your own private locations to a local locations.txt file, in "
"the same format as the main file.  On linux the file is located in "
"``$HOME/.config/ardupilot/locations.txt`` - you will need to create this "
"file using your favourite text editor."
msgstr ""
"您可以将自己的私人位置添加到本地 locations.txt 文件中，格式与主文件相同。在 Linux 上，该文件位于 "
"``$HOME/.config/ardupilot/locations.txt`` ——您需要使用您喜欢的文本编辑器创建此文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:152
#: 6df23cff223a4fd691ff6a96d5568737
msgid "Loading a different default parameter set"
msgstr "加载不同的默认参数集"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:154
#: 21eb9a68dfc748629ab38129fd08667f
msgid ""
"A set of default parameters are automatically selected by the frame type."
" However, you may select a different parameter file by using the ``--add-"
"param-file=`` option, instead of manually loading them via the GCS after "
"the simulation starts:"
msgstr ""
"默认参数集由机架类型自动选择。但是，您可以使用 ``--add-param-file=`` "
"选项选择不同的参数文件，而无需在仿真启动后通过地面站手动加载："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:160
#: d8c13f817b624b8690b92eb2ef5c89ed
msgid ""
"the default working directory will be the directory in which "
"sim_vehicle.py was started."
msgstr "默认工作目录将是 sim_vehicle.py 启动时所在的目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:162
#: 15b3d7321cb94184a54bcd91442c3ab3
msgid ""
"the \"default\" parameter set emulates the parameter default values "
"contained in the firmware. These are used at startup for parameters, "
"UNLESS the user has previously changed them for a parameter(s), in which "
"case those changed values are used. In SITL, these changes are stored in "
"a file in the simulation startup directory named ``eeprom.bin``. If you "
"wish to startup with only the default values, either that file can be "
"erased, or the ``-w`` options can be used."
msgstr ""
"「默认」参数集模拟固件中包含的参数默认值。这些值在启动时用于参数，除非用户之前已更改过某些参数，在这种情况下将使用那些已更改的值。在 SITL "
"中，这些更改存储在仿真启动目录中名为 ``eeprom.bin`` 的文件中。如果希望仅使用默认值启动，可以删除该文件，或使用 ``-w`` "
"选项。"

