#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:221
#: dce6173b3f074cd3961230dfaf73f207
msgid "Swarming with SITL"
msgstr "使用 SITL 进行集群仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:223
#: c2e53f61d19146df90bf9f8544ead85b
msgid ""
"SITL has support for launching multiple vehicles from a single command. "
"With this method, SITL is restricted to launching vehicles of the same "
"type."
msgstr "SITL 支持从单个命令启动多个飞行器。使用此方法时，SITL 只能启动相同类型的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:226
#: 337b3deae96c4444b4f9565378930422
msgid ""
"When launching multiple vehicles, each one will need a unique SysId "
"parameter: :ref:`MAV_SYSID<MAV_SYSID>`. The easiest method to avoid SysId"
" conflicts is with the ``--auto-sysid`` option."
msgstr ""
"启动多个飞行器时，每个飞行器都需要唯一的 SysId 参数：:ref:`MAV_SYSID<MAV_SYSID>`。避免 SysId "
"冲突最简便的方法是使用 ``--auto-sysid`` 选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:229
#: 0ac52771b32348e19c7b8e625f94ce64
msgid "The number of vehicles is set with ``--count`` option."
msgstr "飞行器数量通过 ``--count`` 选项设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:231
#: befe898966134096a99e642d758642b5
msgid ""
"Up to this point, all the vehicles would spawn in the same default "
"location and intersect."
msgstr "到目前为止，所有飞行器都会在同一默认位置生成并相互重叠。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:233
#: d71f2f48f7d8473f86e93d1f1f00e596
msgid ""
"To avoid that, they must be spawned in unique locations. There are two "
"primary approaches, using either a swarm offset line or a swarm "
"configuration file. Both require a location to be set with "
"``--location``."
msgstr "为避免这种情况，必须在不同位置生成飞行器。有两种主要方法：使用集群偏移线或集群配置文件。两者都需要使用 ``--location`` 设置位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:237
#: a7af5314fbb14044a0b2852af4f4c9ce
msgid ""
"When using a swarm offset line, the option ``--auto-offset-line 90,10`` "
"will space the vehicles out at a line with heading of 90 degrees "
"orientation. The vehicles will be spaced 10 meters apart. Thus, they will"
" be spread out east-west."
msgstr ""
"使用集群偏移线时，选项 ``--auto-offset-line 90,10`` 将以 90 度航向的线排列飞行器，飞行器间距为 10 "
"米，即沿东西方向分布。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:241
#: 73b249838c204241bcffdfb7f56a39b2
msgid "To send all mavlink data between the vehicles add ``--mcast``."
msgstr "要在飞行器之间发送所有 MAVLink 数据，请添加 ``--mcast``。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:243
#: 83921bb89ef9422f999a3e5a0f6c0ffe
msgid ""
"Putting it all together for five Copter vehicles on an auto-offset-line "
"at CMAC:"
msgstr "在 CMAC 以自动偏移线启动 5 架 Copter 飞行器的完整示例："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:250
#: 8ea00840b75d4da6ad4176fa39f6f089
msgid ""
"The other way to spawn the vehicles is the swarm configuration file. An "
"example configuration is found in ``Tools/autotest/swarminit.txt``, with "
"the file format described in the header. This allows configurable ENU "
"offsets as well as an initial absolute heading for each vehicle."
msgstr ""
"另一种生成飞行器的方法是集群配置文件。示例配置文件位于 "
"``Tools/autotest/swarminit.txt``，文件头部描述了文件格式。这允许为每个飞行器配置 ENU 偏移量以及初始绝对航向。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:258
#: dd93536ca62b4a8987328688a0aa2b38
msgid ""
":ref:`MavProxy's Multiple Vehicle Guide <mavproxy:multi>` contains "
"information to control the swarm."
msgstr ":ref:`MAVProxy 多飞行器指南 <mavproxy:multi>` 包含控制集群的相关信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:261
#: 5fc7e0c5e3ab48339ac69dbdc25afbd5
msgid "Replaying serial data from Saleae Logic data captures"
msgstr "重放来自 Saleae Logic 数据捕获的串行数据"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:263
#: 6ec0c78059c949d0913989ce1305b20b
msgid ""
"Saleae Logic is often used when decoding and debugging protocols for the "
"first time.  The \"async serial\" analyzers can export the data to a CSV,"
" and this data can then be replayed through ArduPilot's simulated "
"UARTDriver to test parsing of that data."
msgstr ""
"Saleae Logic 常用于首次解码和调试协议时。「异步串行」分析器可以将数据导出为 CSV，然后可以通过 ArduPilot 的模拟 "
"UARTDriver 重放这些数据，以测试数据解析。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:265
#: 0b0de1ca2662400a8f7b63a0752a6f6c
msgid ""
"Serial data is replayed into the simulation at the same rate it appeared "
"on the wire when taking the trace, preserving frame-gaps and the like."
msgstr "串行数据以与在总线上捕获时相同的速率注入仿真，保留帧间隔等特性。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:267
#: 2f220109996c4bed882e9fcc13b9c211
msgid ""
"After you have Logic decoding the serial stream, export the data using "
"this interface element:"
msgstr "在 Logic 解码串行流后，使用以下界面元素导出数据："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:273
#: 3e6ec70dbef947f0be009578a765498a
msgid "That data should be in this format:"
msgstr "该数据应为以下格式："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:288
#: bf7f028a4b3246d0a236faee3705c143
msgid ""
"Place this capture file into the root directory of your ArduPilot "
"repository checkout."
msgstr "将此捕获文件放入 ArduPilot 仓库检出的根目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:290
#: 44011f82fa4041b59517aa4af83853a8
msgid ""
"Specify the schema and filename on the ``sim_vehicle.py`` command-line.  "
"The following example inserts a breakpoint where the data is being read "
"into the parser:"
msgstr "在 ``sim_vehicle.py`` 命令行上指定模式和文件名。以下示例在数据被读入解析器的位置插入一个断点："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:298
#: 85d180de50fc44579fa9dfb90ba72a89
msgid ""
"Your ``SERIAL5_PROTOCOL`` must be set appropriately for this data to be "
"read."
msgstr "您的 ``SERIAL5_PROTOCOL`` 必须设置适当，才能读取此数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:302
#: 2acca458e0e847e68637101a7bb4f35f
msgid ""
"There is a 5s simulated-time delay before data is fed into the simulation"
" from the file."
msgstr "从文件向仿真注入数据前，有 5 秒的仿真时间延迟。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:305
#: db3d7b92c4b84dc098897826466d5446
msgid "Using a different GCS instead of MAVProxy"
msgstr "使用不同地面站代替 MAVProxy"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:307
#: 5edbb573d388413c950ee8184dd6fabb
msgid ""
"Start ``sim_vehicle`` without starting MAVProxy using the ``--no-"
"mavproxy`` option. SITL will be listening for any GGS station to connect "
"via TCP port 5760."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``--no-mavproxy`` 选项启动 ``sim_vehicle``，不启动 MAVProxy。SITL 将通过 TCP 端口 "
"5760 等待任何地面站连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:310
#: 5d26be16fb224079bf6b9efa3859edcc
msgid ""
"Many GCS can only initiate the connection via TCP. For Mission Planner or"
" QGC, select TCP, the host ip that sim_vehicle is running on or 127.0.0.1"
" if running locally, and connect."
msgstr ""
"许多地面站只能通过 TCP 发起连接。对于 Mission Planner 或 QGC，选择 TCP，输入运行 sim_vehicle 的主机 "
"IP（如在本地运行则为 127.0.0.1），然后连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:315
#: 9ed63f1590b34988b936be749ff6acd4
msgid "Mission Planner: Connecting toSITL using TCP"
msgstr "Mission Planner：使用 TCP 连接到 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:318
#: 6466739856004d33b0c2a8ff5452d637
msgid "Using a different GCS instead of MAVProxy (via UDP)"
msgstr "使用不同地面站代替 MAVProxy（通过 UDP）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:320
#: 2d22900579994f3c98599b7539908308
msgid ""
"To connect another GCS using the ``--no-mavproxy`` option and UDP "
"requires adding a startup option to have the simulation output heartbeats"
" on UDP so the GCS can connect:"
msgstr "要使用 ``--no-mavproxy`` 选项通过 UDP 连接其他地面站，需要添加启动选项以使仿真在 UDP 上输出心跳包，以便地面站连接："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:326
#: d642393b1c5d43cbae69d1788db85966
msgid ""
"where <gcs ip> would be 127.0.0.1 if the GCS is on the same PC or the ip "
"address of a remote PC running a GCS"
msgstr "其中 <gcs ip> 若地面站在同一台 PC 上则为 127.0.0.1，否则为运行地面站的远程 PC 的 IP 地址"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:328
#: 48448ae814564b60a36a5a74c98b096a
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner, connect to the SITL UDP port by selecting **UDP** and"
" then the **Connect** button. Enter the port to listen on (the default "
"port number of 14550 should be correct if SITL is running on the same "
"computer)."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 中，选择 **UDP** 然后点击 **Connect** 按钮连接到 SITL UDP "
"端口。输入要监听的端口（如果 SITL 在同一台计算机上运行，默认端口号 14550 应该正确）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:336
#: 211a9fcdb03b4c4fa76b063396459ac9
msgid "Mission Planner: Connecting to a UDPPort"
msgstr "Mission Planner：连接到 UDP 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:339
#: 9ae46439eb16454f8ef5c551e6b2f9eb
msgid "Using Mission Planner's Simulation feature"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 的仿真功能"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:341
#: eefcaed869bc46f69a11e08d3e44c081
msgid ""
"Instead of using ``sim_vehicle.py`` under Linux or WSL, you can also "
"simulate using Mission Planner's simulation feature."
msgstr "除了在 Linux 或 WSL 下使用 ``sim_vehicle.py`` 外，您还可以使用 Mission Planner 的仿真功能进行仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:343
#: 43d11fc04b274369a370e570447071c5
msgid "See :ref:`mission-planner-simulation`"
msgstr "参见 :ref:`mission-planner-simulation`"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:348
#: 593a5689e4b942f5be2822e5682d1856
msgid "Connecting other/additional ground stations"
msgstr "连接其他/附加地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:350
#: 84b50d3c22034247bbfe47479a17eef3
msgid ""
"SITL can connect to multiple ground stations by using MAVProxy or Mission"
" Planner to forward UDP packets to the GCSs network address."
msgstr "SITL 可以通过使用 MAVProxy 或 Mission Planner 将 UDP 数据包转发到地面站网络地址来连接多个地面站。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:356
#: 2c667a92bbbb4dec91a35d6ff88aef72
msgid "Using MAVProxy (UDP) forwarding"
msgstr "使用 MAVProxy（UDP）转发"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:358
#: 277dab2e2a2e44899a81f1a5a969ced5
msgid ""
"Multiple ground stations can be connected to SITL by using MAVProxy to "
"forward UDP packets to the GCSs network address (for example, forwarding "
"to another Windows box or Android tablet on your local network). The "
"simulated vehicle can then be controlled and viewed through any attached "
"GCS."
msgstr ""
"多个地面站可以通过 MAVProxy 将 UDP 数据包转发到地面站网络地址（例如，转发到本地网络上的另一台 Windows 机器或 "
"Android 平板）连接到 SITL。仿真飞行器可以通过任何连接的地面站进行控制和查看。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:364
#: 2db807e5306544b4902144971ea4024d
msgid ""
"First find the IP address of the machine running the GCS. How you get the"
" address is platform dependent (on Windows you can use the 'ipconfig' "
"command to find the computer's address)."
msgstr "首先找到运行地面站的机器的 IP 地址。获取地址的方法取决于平台（在 Windows 上可以使用「ipconfig」命令查找计算机地址）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:368
#: 501b7ae931494144b4a038d40dd95185
msgid ""
"Assuming the IP address of the GCS is 192.168.14.82, you would add this "
"address/port as a MAVProxy output using:"
msgstr "假设地面站的 IP 地址为 192.168.14.82，您可以使用以下方法将该地址/端口添加为 MAVProxy 输出："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:375
#: 8ee8f45925284685ac7b1fbd0a79c2a0
msgid "The GCS would then connect to SITL by listening on that UDP port."
msgstr "地面站随后通过监听该 UDP 端口连接到 SITL。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:379
#: f17789e49e9d4aa59bee7360fb2abd86
msgid ""
"If you're running the GCS on the **same machine** as SITL then an "
"appropriate output may already exist. Check this by calling ``output`` on"
" the *MAVProxy command prompt*:"
msgstr ""
"如果您在与 SITL **相同的机器** 上运行地面站，则可能已经存在适当的输出。可以通过在 *MAVProxy 命令提示符*下调用 "
"``output`` 来检查："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:390
#: 870e975915064a21a0e3cba1dae53522
msgid ""
"In this case we can connect a GCS running on the same machine to UDP port"
" 14550 or 14551. We can choose to connect another GCS to the remaining "
"port, and add more ports if needed."
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，我们可以将运行在同一机器上的地面站连接到 UDP 端口 14550 或 "
"14551。我们可以选择将另一个地面站连接到剩余端口，并根据需要添加更多端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:395
#: cde8b41f9ef54e95bc79c993d15dbc67
msgid "Using Mission Planner Forwarding"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 转发"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:397
#: a19a7f220b9c4d3bb4fbf3e433d325e7
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Mission Planner can forward to other GCS using it Mavlink Mirror. Under "
"SETUP/Advanced/Mavlink Mirror set the connection type (usually UDP "
"Client), baud rate (11520 for UDP),optional write access to allow the "
"connecting GCS to changes things, and press connect. A listening GCS will"
" automatically connect to SITL."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 可以通过其 Mavlink Mirror 转发到其他地面站。在 SETUP/Advanced/Mavlink "
"Mirror 下设置连接类型（通常为 UDP Client）、波特率（UDP 为 "
"11520）、可选写入权限以允许连接的地面站更改设置，然后点击连接。监听的地面站将自动连接到 SITL。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:403
#: cdf0d321105843eeabaed31baad22da1
msgid "SITL Simulation Parameters"
msgstr "SITL 仿真参数"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:411
#: 60dbaf94b5b6485697a041bbd6aaa2a0
msgid "Adding simulated devices to sim_vehicle"
msgstr "向 sim_vehicle 添加模拟设备"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:419
#: 770e0d9f23f349d1819f5ea14e7522df
msgid "Accessing log files"
msgstr "访问日志文件"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:421
#: 044b53d617604cc488fe6e6ea1d1d336
msgid ""
"SITL supports both Block Logging and SD card storage DataFlash logs (the "
"same as used with physical autopilots). The SD card logs are stored in a "
"\"logs\" subdirectory in the directory where you start sim_vehicle or in "
"Mission Planner's sitl/logs directory in the its documents folder. The "
"Block Flash logs are stored in the blackbox.bin file. You can also access"
" the logs via MAVLink using a GCS, but directly accessing SD card "
"emulated logs in the logs/ directory is usually more convenient."
msgstr ""
"SITL 同时支持块日志和 SD 卡存储的 DataFlash 日志（与物理飞控使用的相同）。SD 卡日志存储在启动 sim_vehicle "
"的目录下的「logs」子目录中，或 Mission Planner 文档文件夹的 sitl/logs 目录中。块闪存日志存储在 "
"blackbox.bin 文件中。您也可以通过地面站使用 MAVLink 访问日志，但直接访问 logs/ 目录中的 SD "
"卡模拟日志通常更为方便。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:425
#: ba53d81674594e5eaac8b24584057d5b
msgid ""
"To keep your logs organized it is recommended you start SITL using the \""
"--aircraft NAME\" option. That will create a subdirectory called NAME "
"which will have flight logs organized by date. Each simulation run will "
"get its own directory, and will include the parameters for the flight "
"plus any downloaded waypoints and rally points."
msgstr ""
"为保持日志有序，建议使用「--aircraft NAME」选项启动 SITL。这将创建一个名为 NAME "
"的子目录，其中包含按日期整理的飞行日志。每次仿真运行都会获得自己的目录，并包含飞行参数以及任何下载的航点和集结点。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:432
#: 650e41ecd420483fb509b97e5da22b44
msgid "Graphing vehicle state"
msgstr "绘制飞行器状态图"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:434
#: e8fc5afae04f4ffc9ac4d1bed02aede1
msgid ""
"MAVProxy allows you to create graphs of inputs, outputs, internal "
"variables, etc. by loading the ``graph`` module."
msgstr "MAVProxy 允许您通过加载 ``graph`` 模块来创建输入、输出、内部变量等的图表。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:442
#: 96bf81fc645f4003b6ae190c5399d546
msgid ""
"You can then create graphs of vehicle state using the graph command. For "
"example, to graph the RC channel 3 input during the simulation:"
msgstr "然后可以使用 graph 命令创建飞行器状态图。例如，要在仿真期间绘制 RC 通道 3 的输入："

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:448
#: c3c8998c870c4665b902a88eb22a2568
msgid ""
"As with most commands, you can type ``graph`` and then double tab to see "
"available completions. In the example above the `RC_CHANNELS` group "
"contains the 16 rc channels, so typing ``graph RC_CHANNELS``, then double"
" tab would show those."
msgstr ""
"与大多数命令一样，您可以输入 ``graph`` 然后双击 TAB 键查看可用补全项。在上面的例子中，`RC_CHANNELS` 组包含 16 个"
" RC 通道，因此输入 ``graph RC_CHANNELS`` 然后双击 TAB 键将显示这些通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:450
#: f3db7d2d3185456bbdd25fb9c87625ed
msgid ""
"Since these are rather long to type, MAVProxy allows for the creation of "
"shorter aliases.  There have been many aliases created in a file present "
"in the ArduPilot source tree in the Tools/vagrant sub-directory called "
"**mavinit.scr**. If this file is copied and placed in your home directory"
" and renamed to **.mavinit.scr**, it will be used upon *MAVProxy's* "
"initialization.  Common ones are: *g* for graph, *grc* to graph the RC "
"inputs, *gservo8* to graph the first 8 output channels instead of typing "
"long item names eight times, etc. Using this alias initialization file "
"also has the advantage of automatically loading the graph module upon "
"startup, so you will not have to load it."
msgstr ""
"由于这些命令输入较长，MAVProxy 允许创建更短的别名。在 ArduPilot 源代码树的 Tools/vagrant 子目录中有一个名为 "
"**mavinit.scr** 的文件，其中已创建了许多别名。如果将该文件复制到主目录并重命名为 **.mavinit.scr**，则会在 "
"*MAVProxy* 初始化时使用它。常用别名有：*g* 表示 graph，*grc* 表示绘制 RC 输入图，*gservo8* 表示绘制前 8"
" 个输出通道图（无需输入 8 次长项目名称）等。使用此别名初始化文件还有一个优点：在启动时自动加载 graph 模块，因此您不必手动加载它。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:452
#: c765b636cbf845e0bbc2749770fd97ab
msgid ""
"Mission Planner allows graphing using the \"tuning\" box in the DATA "
"tab's map screen. Checking that box will open a graph screen. Double "
"clicking it will present a selection dialog of what messages/data to "
"graph."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 允许使用 DATA "
"选项卡地图界面中的「tuning」复选框进行绘图。勾选该复选框将打开图表界面。双击将弹出选择对话框，用于选择要绘制的消息/数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:455
#: 84a45ff2c7b540df84eb66b345e9c822
msgid "Using a joystick"
msgstr "使用摇杆"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:457
#: 234a4bfdc2fd45cbb85be93729eb594d
msgid ""
"It can be useful to use a joystick for input in SITL. The joystick can be"
" a real RC transmitter with a USB dongle for the trainer port, or "
"something like the RealFlight interlink controller or a wide range of "
"other joystick devices."
msgstr ""
"在 SITL 中使用摇杆输入很有用。摇杆可以是带有 USB 教练端口适配器的真实遥控器，或者像 RealFlight Interlink "
"控制器这样的设备，或各种其他摇杆设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing.rst:462
#: c7d6c2dff1cc4358a940330134c71479
msgid ""
"Before you use the joystick support you may need to remove debug "
"statements from the python-pygame joystick driver on Linux. If you don't "
"then you may see lots of debug output like this:"
